.SS CVE\-2026\-63030
WordPress Core, added 2026\-07\-21.
.PP
WordPress Core Interpretation Conflict Vulnerability.
.PP
\fIHow it is exploited (CISA):\fR
WordPress Core contains an interpretation conflict vulnerability that could allow an attacker to perform SQL Injection and achieve Remote Code Execution. This vulnerability can be chained with CVE\-2026\-60137.
.PP
\fIRemediation:\fR
Apply vendor mitigations; follow CISA BOD 26\-04 (risk\-based patching) and forensics triage. Discontinue use if no mitigation exists.
 Due 2026\-07\-24.
.PP
